.DS_Store

# site/audio/ used to be ignored here: the ~550 MB of Listening tracks were kept
# out of the repository and carried alongside the site by hand. They are
# committed now, so a deploy ships them with everything else and AUDIO_BASE can
# stay empty. Keep an eye on the total — GitHub Pages starts warning past ~1 GB,
# and the repo sits near 800 MB once the PDFs are counted.

# The paid books. site/tools/split_content.py moves them here out of
# site/data/, and site/tools/upload_content.py pushes them to Supabase, which is
# the only place a reader can get them from. This repository is public, so a
# paid book committed anywhere in it is a paid book anyone can download and the
# lock in the app becomes a picture of a lock.
#
# They are not lost by being ignored: the builders regenerate them from the PDFs
# in site/pdf/, and the copy that serves readers lives in the book_content table.
content/

# Python bytecode from the build tools.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local scratch for the build tools; nothing in the repo needs a secret.
.env
.venv/

# The standalone vocab-srs prototype keeps its dependencies here. The deck that
# ships lives in site/srs.js and needs none of them, and 107 MB of node_modules
# would swamp a repository already near the Pages size warning.
node_modules/

# Local tool settings; not part of the project. The pattern has to be anchored
# with ** — a plain `.claude/…` matches only at the repository root, which left
# vocab-srs/.claude/ showing up as untracked.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
